#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power Cell 1"
msgstr "Batteria 1"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruct a bot to change the power cell of a nearby winged shooter."
msgstr ""
"Insegna a un robot a cambiare la batteria di un tiratore volante vicino."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spider2"
msgstr "Spider2"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Objective"
msgstr "Obiettivo"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Program the <a object|botgr>grabber bot</a> to change the <a "
"object|power>power cell</a> of the <a object|botfj>winged shooter</a>. The "
"winged shooter can then shoot the spiders."
msgstr ""
"Programma il <a object|botgr>robot trasportatore</a> perché cambi la <a "
"object|power>batteria</a> del <a object|botfj>tiratore volante</a>, che "
"potrà così sparare ai ragni."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Procedura"

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Program the <a object|botgr>grabber bot</a>."
msgstr "Programma il <a object|botgr>robot trasportatore</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the program with the arrow button <button 21/>."
msgstr "Esegui con la freccia <button 21/>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|botfj>winged shooter</a> is already programmed, it will do its"
" job as soon as it has got a new power cell."
msgstr ""
"Il <a object|botfj>tiratore volante</a> è già programmato: agirà appena "
"riceve una batteria nuova."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Program"
msgstr "Programma"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will need the following instructions:"
msgstr "Ti serviranno queste istruzioni:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "grab();<n/>"
msgstr "grab();<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "<n/>Takes whatever there is in front of the bot."
msgstr "<n/>Prende ciò che si trova davanti al robot."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "drop();<n/>"
msgstr "drop();<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "<n/>Drops whatever the bot is carrying in front."
msgstr "<n/>Posa davanti al robot l’oggetto trasportato."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "turn();<n/>"
msgstr "turn();<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<n/>We have seen this instruction already in the previous exercise: it "
"performs a rotation of a certain angle, given in degrees."
msgstr ""
"<n/>Questa istruzione, già vista nell’esercizio precedente, ruota il robot "
"dell’angolo indicato in gradi."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "pick up the empty power cell with <c/>grab();<n/>"
msgstr "prendi la batteria scarica con <c/>grab();<n/>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "turn left 90 degrees (quarter turn) with <code>turn(90)</code>"
msgstr "gira di 90 gradi a sinistra con <code>turn(90)</code>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "drop the empty cell with <c/>drop();<n/>"
msgstr "posa la batteria scarica con <c/>drop();<n/>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "etc."
msgstr "ecc."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is up to you now to write the rest of the program!"
msgstr "Ora tocca a te completare il programma!"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have got a problem, you can always look at the solution: select the "
"<code>Solution</code> program, and click the braces button <button 22/>."
msgstr ""
"Se hai difficoltà, seleziona il programma <code>Solution</code> e premi le "
"graffe <button 22/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remarks"
msgstr "Osservazioni"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be careful to write the instructions precisely, respecting lower and upper "
"case letters."
msgstr ""
"Scrivi le istruzioni con precisione, rispettando maiuscole e minuscole."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Always write one instruction per line, finishing each line with a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"Scrivi un’istruzione per riga, terminandola sempre con un punto e virgola."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In case your program does not do exactly what you wanted, you can put the "
"bot back at the starting point with the button <button 59/>. You can also "
"start over again from the beginning (hit the key \"Esc\", the click "
"\"Restart\"). The program you have written will not be lost."
msgstr ""
"Se il programma non fa ciò che volevi, riporta il robot alla partenza con "
"<button 59/>. Puoi ricominciare con Esc e «Ricomincia»: il programma non "
"andrà perso."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> permette di rileggere queste istruzioni in "
"ogni momento."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let us see the beginning of the program:"
msgstr "Vediamo l’inizio del programma:"
